---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: A job behind Harden-Runner
    accDescr: Harden-Runner blocks every host that the job doesn't name. The job then asks each of its hosts every 3 seconds, for two minutes at most, until Harden-Runner lets it through, and runs its steps. Without sudo and Docker, it waits until Harden-Runner has removed Docker. A job that ends is done. One that hangs until its time limit ends as cancelled, and a bot runs its cancelled jobs once more; when that hangs too, a required check stays cancelled for you, and a bot gets an issue.

    block["Harden-Runner blocks every host<br>that the job doesn't name"]
    warm["The job asks each of its hosts,<br>every 3 s, for 2 minutes at most"]
    steps["The steps of the job"]
    docker["Wait until Harden-Runner<br>has removed Docker"]
    ends{"Does the job end?"}
    done["Done"]
    again["A bot runs the cancelled jobs<br>once more"]
    you["A check stays cancelled,<br>a bot gets an issue"]

    block --> warm
    warm --> steps
    steps --> docker
    docker --> ends
    ends -- "yes" --> done
    ends -- "hangs until its time limit" --> again
    again -- "ends" --> done
    again -- "hangs again" --> you

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class warm,docker,again bot
    class you person
    class done done
